1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
Ever heard the phrase, bite the bullet?

2
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:04,019
It's not just a saying.

3
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:06,160
Soldiers actually did it.

4
00:00:06,599 --> 00:00:10,080
Back in the day, during battlefield surgeries, there was no anesthesia.

5
00:00:10,439 --> 00:00:14,900
So they bit down on a bullet to focus the pain and keep from screaming.

6
00:00:15,619 --> 00:00:18,339
Next time you hear it, you'll know it came from real pain.

7
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:21,559
Divya, why are you doing this today?

8
00:00:21,699 --> 00:00:23,140
I'm going to bite the bullet today.

9
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:26,000
Wait, do you know what bite the bullet means?

10
00:00:26,219 --> 00:00:26,920
Let me tell you.

11
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:31,660
It means to finish the work, no matter how unsatisfying or unpleasant it is.

12
00:00:31,859 --> 00:00:33,359
Now I'm going to bite the bullet.

13
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:34,299
Bye guys.

